CORE
main.cpp
--cpp20 --object-bits 11 --no-unwinding-assertions
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ closure object operator\(\) call: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ closure passed by value to template: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ closure copy then call: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ closure converts to function pointer: SUCCESS$
